  {
   "id": "the-mooseman-27358@major-2017-02-20",
   "gameId": "the-mooseman-27358",
   "displayName": "An Update! / Обновление",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2017-02-20T16:42:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "* Added a collider in the Middle world, near Vorsa, so it is impossible now to fall into the unknown abyss of glitches",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* The music now continues to play when you enter the collectible or myth menu by pressing F1 or F2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* The screen darkening is increased in the menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed a bunch of typos",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Теперь нельзя провалиться под текстуры в среднем мире у Ворсы, пойдя влево",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Теперь музыка не останавливается при входе в меню по F1 и F2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Затемнение экрана при включении меню увеличено",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Исправлен ряд опечаток",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All the discovered bugs please post in our community hub: http://steamcommunity.com/app/574310/discussions/0/135509314047108656/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
